WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.320
The primary benchmark designs novel inhibitors
binding the NSP15 site of SARS-CoV-2.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:10.206
Binding affinity is estimated by molecular docking,

00:00:10.286 --> 00:00:14.701
using a GPU-accelerated tool on the protein's 3D
structure,

00:00:14.781 --> 00:00:20.415
starting from a dataset of purchasable molecules
with NSP15 docking scores.

00:00:20.495 --> 00:00:26.510
The method is also tested on standard QED and
penalized LogP optimization tasks.
